PERIOD_CHECKSUM
Usage: node scripts/recover-report-set-source.js evidence.json --source before|after
Verifies the entire bundle, then writes the selected original JSON to stdout. No network, imports or input writes.
Output includes full unencrypted original addresses, balances, history and notes. Redirect it only to an intended local file.
Exit 0: original recovered and comparison matches; 2: original recovered but comparison differs; 1: invalid input with no original output.
